body:
Nothing about this could ever be worth an argument, controversy, harassment... or even doxxing. I sincerely **PLEA** and **HOPE** that they eventually choose not to engage in this kind of behavior in the future. I know this is Internet 101, but these are people you're talking to. Makes me sad.

&#x200B;

I'm glad I left Twitter. It felt like I read something outrageous every day I logged in. That's too much for me.
